message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "civic-tech-crawler"
abstract: >-
  A Python command-line tool that crawls GitHub repositories and collects
  repository-health, contributor, and temporal metrics for empirical studies of
  civic technology and other small open-source ecosystems. It implements CHAOSS
  and DORA indicators, bot detection, a commit-history fallback for GitHub's
  asynchronous statistics endpoints, and detection of AI-assisted development
  and shipped LLM features.
